<title>JAPAN: Hokkaido Takushoku forgives 32 bln yen jusen loans.</title>
<headline>Hokkaido Takushoku forgives 32 bln yen jusen loans.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hokkaido Takushoku Bank Ltd said on Monday it had forgiven 32 billion yen in loans to Nippon Housing Loan Co Ltd.</p>
<p>It said forgiving the loans to the mortgage firm would not affect its earnings for the current 1996/97 business year ending on March 31.</p>
</text>
